  <div>
    {{!-- Which Defense this attack is tested against is the DEFENDER's own choice (or the item's
         fixed suggestion, when they don't override it) - not something to let the attacker pick
         here (see mechanics/combat/defense-choice.mjs's own doc comment for the full RAW citation and why
         this used to be an editable dropdown). This is display-only, so the defending side's own
         prompt always starts from the weapon's actual suggestion regardless of what this shows;
         the hidden input still submits it through as that suggestion. --}}
    {{localize 'E20.RollDialogDefenseType'}}
    <span>{{localize (lookup defenseTypes defenseType)}}</span>
    <input type="hidden" name="defenseType" value="{{defenseType}}" />
  </div>
</div>
